  "title": "Q025 퀴즈 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "A company needs fixed IP addresses and optimized routing to healthy TCP endpoints in multiple Regions. Which service should it use?",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>퀴즈</span></nav><section class=\"quiz-page\"><div class=\"quiz-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">QUESTION 025</p><h1>퀴즈</h1></div><strong>25 / 108</strong></div><div class=\"quiz-progress\" aria-label=\"25번째 문제\"><span style=\"width:23%\"></span></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q025\" data-question=\"Q025\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q025</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs fixed IP addresses and optimized routing to healthy TCP endpoints in multiple Regions. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Transfer Acceleration alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudFront object caching alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q025\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Global Accelerator</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a>는 anycast 고정 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 글로벌 네트워크를 활용해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">엔드포인트</a>로 전달한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/globalacc/\">Global Accelerator</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a></div></article><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"문제 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q024/\">이전 문제 <b>Q024</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q026/\">다음 문제 <b>Q026</b></a></span></nav><p class=\"save-note\">선택과 채점 결과는 이 브라우저에 자동 저장됩니다.</p></section>"
}
